  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: You are descended from a janni or otherwise embody a dichotomy of
    opposing elemental planar forces. You gain the suli trait, in addition to the
    traits from your ancestry. You also gain low-light vision, or you gain darkvision
    if your ancestry already has low-light vision. You can choose from suli feats
    and feats from your ancestry whenever you gain an ancestry feat.
